ne we know that in order to  obtain the soul stone one must sacrifice  one that they love now obviously there  are just so many different scenarios  that could play out here but I think the  one that everybody thinks about is  Captain America sacrificing himself so  Ironman can obtain the soul stone  obviously this is just speculation and  theorizing we have no way of knowing  what's really going to happen but this  is what I think about when I hear  sacrifices that and I picture Captain  America lifting up Thor's hammer yelling  Avengers Assemble as he goes and takes  on Thanos  I think if any of the Avengers are going  to sacrifice themselves to save another  Avenger or the rest of the Avengers it's  definitely going to be Captain America  so although we don't know for sure what  is going to happen in Avengers for right  now we definitely know that it's going  to be a super intense movie and it will  be a turning point in the MCU so that's  it for the synopsis breakdown let me  know what you all think about this  synopsis let me know what you all think  about the turning point fragile reality  and sacrifices in the comments below  don't forget to subscribe comment and  like the video so you can enter the  giveaway and stay up to date with  everything relating to Avengers 4 as  always thank you all so much for  watching  woof woof  [Music]  you
 

